{
  "duration": 44.55,
  "lines": [
    {
      "who": "arjun",
      "text": "Nimi! Websites are going offline all over the world!",
      "start": 0.25,
      "dur": 2.9,
      "wav": "line_0.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "nimi",
      "text": "Relax. Two critical flaws were just found in PHP. They're nicknamed PHP2Shell.",
      "start": 3.5,
      "dur": 5.38,
      "wav": "line_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "arjun",
      "text": "P-H-what?",
      "start": 9.23,
      "dur": 0.678,
      "wav": "line_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "nimi",
      "text": "PHP is the code behind about 70% of websites whose server language is known.",
      "start": 10.258,
      "dur": 5.012,
      "wav": "line_3.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "arjun",
      "text": "So who found the bugs?",
      "start": 15.62,
      "dur": 1.018,
      "wav": "line_4.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "nimi",
      "text": "Researchers, with help from AI. Calif used OpenAI's GPT-5.6 Sol, and Wiz found both flaws too.",
      "start": 16.988,
      "dur": 6.248,
      "wav": "line_5.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "arjun",
      "text": "The AI is the detective?!",
      "start": 23.585,
      "dur": 1.368,
      "wav": "line_6.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "nimi",
      "text": "The flaws could let an attacker run code on a server, no password needed.",
      "start": 25.304,
      "dur": 3.58,
      "wav": "line_7.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "nimi",
      "text": "So the NSA warned: patch now, or take your site offline until you can.",
      "start": 29.234,
      "dur": 4.317,
      "wav": "line_8.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "arjun",
      "text": "That's why sites went dark!",
      "start": 33.901,
      "dur": 1.119,
      "wav": "line_9.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "nimi",
      "text": "Exactly. PHP released fixes on October 21, and sites are updating.",
      "start": 35.37,
      "dur": 4.628,
      "wav": "line_10.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "arjun",
      "text": "So the internet isn't broken... it's getting a vaccine!",
      "start": 40.348,
      "dur": 2.452,
      "wav": "line_11.wav"
    }
  ]
}